# 跨平台文本/二进制属性：避免 Windows 检出时把 LF 转成 CRLF 破坏 shell 脚本
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制（不要做换行/编码转换）
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dmg binary
*.zst binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
